  "scope": "Independent MLSys supplement; frozen V1 artifacts are unchanged",
  "wall": "Recorded L/S/A full-original-output endpoints after all 20 original tool intervals; each arm starts after its own H prime; S includes summary wait; A post-primary summary await is separate",
  "await": "async_post_foreground_summary_wait_mean_s uses the recorded future join wait when available; response-ready wait is separate. The inherited await_all total columns end at max(primary endpoint, summary response-ready); harness total additionally contains post-response metrics/instrumentation and future join",
  "validation": "Independent no-gap exclusive-engine L/S/K actual curves; standard estimated_total_s/relative_error/engine_residual_s compare against the frozen historical reconstruction; updated_* compare against the new explicitly pooled fit. Both residuals are cross-session and cannot isolate fit error from VM/session variation",
  "calibration": "Historical low-context and new high-context calibration are explicitly pooled across sessions of the same model configuration; conditional reconstruction, not a same-session validation of historical timing",
  "coverage": "Every reconstructed decode context prompt + original O - 1 must lie within the observed initial-prompt domain; unsupported entire curves and paybacks remain null",
  "prediction": "Frozen predicted 11/13 are retained from the historical V1 reconstruction; updated prediction and measured validation crossover are separate fields"
 }
